# Delivery plan revision 18: V3 scoped formal ADR check and final local validation passed; legacy ADR/SealGraph toolchain limits remain active.
project pj001:
  version 6
  title "Connect character goals, tactics and expression after Compact observation v2"
  description "Implement Accepted ADR-0025 with separate closed expressionState and utteranceHistory inputs, closed nextUtterance output, content-independent acceptance, and the existing battle revision commit boundary. Under Accepted ADR-0026, allow one fail-closed Compact V2 deep-psyche application repair over a server-defined semantic closure; add no expression retry, recursive repair, lifecycle entity, identifier, receipt, reuse detector, similarity gate, critic, or fallback."
  as_of 2026-09-09
  duration_unit point
  velocity 1p/1d
  finish m011
  # Increment estimates are provisional; re-estimate after CA-00 and design review.
  # Next scope: responsibility design start, remaining CA-00, CA-01 with minimal CA-02.
  # ADR-0027 psyche-only, unified conscious judgment and engine authority control new scope.
  # Seven PSYCHE-RESPONSIBILITY sites are one migration design, not seven isolated fixes.
  # Repair plan: docs/character-agency-implementation-plan-v1.md revision 5.
  # t026 completed with typed fixtures and rubric; no claim of model-quality improvement.
  # t029-A -> B -> C -> D are internal packages, not additional tasks or earned progress.
  # Plan approval does not accept a new architecture or authorize provider/deployment effects.

